msgstr ""

msgid ""
"from `quarkus` (Quarkus Core) or `quarkus/extensions` directory, it will use "
"the 'Quarkus Core' extension layout and defaults."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"with `-DgroupId=io.quarkiverse.[extensionId]`, it will use the 'Quarkiverse' "
"extension layout and defaults."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"in other cases it will use the 'Standalone' extension layout and defaults."
msgstr ""

msgid "we may introduce other layout types in the future."
msgstr ""

