"this includes the ability to register creation functions for classes without "
"no-arg constructors, to register an object\n"
"substitution (basically a transformer from a non-serializable object to a "
"serializable one and vice versa), and to create\n"
"a class proxy. This interface can be directly injected as a method parameter "
"into any `@Record` method."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
